>> title: Braised Short Ribs
>> category: Stews & Braises
>> tags: beef, wine, oven, braise, sunday dinner
>> counters: Meat and Three
>> servings: 6
>> time: 4 hr
>> step.5: braise 325°F 3 hr

Preheat the #oven{} to 325°F (160°C).

Season @bone-in beef short ribs{5%lb}(2.3 kg; cut in 3-in lengths) with @kosher salt{1%Tbs}, @black pepper{2%tsp}.

Sear @&(~1)seasoned short ribs{}, @vegetable oil{2%Tbs} in a #Dutch oven{}.

Soften @yellow onions{2%large}(chopped), @carrots{2%large}(chopped), @celery{2%ribs}(chopped), @garlic{6%cloves}, @tomato paste{3%Tbs} with @&(~1)seared short ribs{}.

Braise @&(~1)pot{} with @dry red wine{3%cup}(710 mL; most of a bottle), @beef stock{4%cup}(950 mL), @thyme{6%sprigs} for ~{3%hr}.
